23, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "2. for torch_batch in train_loader", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "2. for torch_batch in train_loader"}, {"id": "m48-016", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 566, "width": 548, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000016, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000116, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0G", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Dataset returns one CHW image + label.\nLoader stacks items into a batch.\nshuffle=False keeps manifest order.\nA final smaller batch is kept.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Dataset returns one CHW image + label.\nLoader stacks items into a batch.\nshuffle=False keeps manifest order.\nA final smaller batch is kept.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Dataset returns one CHW image + label.\nLoader stacks items into a batch.\nshuffle=False keeps manifest order.\nA final smaller batch is kept."}, {"id": "m48-017", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 722, "width": 548, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000017, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000117, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0H", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: Dataset and DataLoader", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: Dataset and DataLoader", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: Dataset and DataLoader"}, {"id": "m48-018", "type": "rectangle", "x": 830, "y": 500, "width": 600, "height": 260, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000018, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000118, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0I", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-019", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 520, "width": 548, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000019, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000119, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0J", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "GalaxyTorchDataset.__getitem__()", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "GalaxyTorchDataset.__getitem__()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "GalaxyTorchDataset.__getitem__()"}, {"id": "m48-020", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 566, "width": 548, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000020, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000120, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0K", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "A: CHW (3,3,3), label 1 = spiral\nB: CHW (3,3,3), label 2 = lenticular\nBatch images: NCHW (2,3,3,3)\nBatch labels: [1,2], shape (2,)\nStacking does not mix the images.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "A: CHW (3,3,3), label 1 = spiral\nB: CHW (3,3,3), label 2 = lenticular\nBatch images: NCHW (2,3,3,3)\nBatch labels: [1,2], shape (2,)\nStacking does not mix the images.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "A: CHW (3,3,3), label 1 = spiral\nB: CHW (3,3,3), label 2 = lenticular\nBatch images: NCHW (2,3,3,3)\nBatch labels: [1,2], shape (2,)\nStacking does not mix the images."}, {"id": "m48-021", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 722, "width": 548, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000021, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000121, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0L", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: stacking batches", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: stacking batches", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: stacking batches"}, {"id": "m48-022", "type": "arrow", "x": 390, "y": 765, "width": 0, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000022, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000122, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0M", "points": [[0, 0], [0, 60]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-023", "type": "text", "x": 414, "y": 777, "width": 520, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000023, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000123, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0N", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "each batch supplies image and label tensors", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "each batch supplies image and label tensors", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "each batch supplies image and label tensors"}, {"id": "m48-024", "type": "rectangle", "x": 90, "y": 830, "width": 600, "height": 215, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000024, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000124, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0O", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-025", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 850, "width": 548, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000025, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 48000125, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0P", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "3. TinyGalaxyCNN.forward()", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "3. TinyGalaxyCNN.forward()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "3. TinyGalaxyCNN.forward()"}, {"id": "m48-026", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 896, "width": 548, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000026, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000126, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0Q", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Clear old gradients before the forward pass.\nCurrent weights turn images into logits.\n(2,3,3,3) input -> (2,4) raw scores.\nNo weights change during this calculation.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Clear old gradients before the forward pass.\nCurrent weights turn images into logits.\n(2,3,3,3) input -> (2,4) raw scores.\nNo weights change during this calculation.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Clear old gradients before the forward pass.\nCurrent weights turn images into logits.\n(2,3,3,3) input -> (2,4) raw scores.\nNo weights change during this calculation."}, {"id": "m48-027", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 1007, "width": 548, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000027, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000127, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0R", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: forward pass", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: forward pass", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: forward pass"}, {"id": "m48-028", "type": "rectangle", "x": 830, "y": 830, "width": 600, "height": 215, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000028, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000128, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0S", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-029", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 850, "width": 548, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000029, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000129, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0T", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "What are the four scores?", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "What are the four scores?", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "What are the four scores?"}, {"id": "m48-030", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 896, "width": 548, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000030, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000130, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0U", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "One score per class, per image.\nSoftmax can turn scores into probabilities.\nCrossEntropyLoss takes raw logits directly,\nnot already-softmaxed probabilities.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "One score per class, per image.\nSoftmax can turn scores into probabilities.\nCrossEntropyLoss takes raw logits directly,\nnot already-softmaxed probabilities.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "One score per class, per image.\nSoftmax can turn scores into probabilities.\nCrossEntropyLoss takes raw logits directly,\nnot already-softmaxed probabilities."}, {"id": "m48-031", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 1007, "width": 548, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000031, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000131, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0V", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: logits, probabilities, loss", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: logits, probabilities, loss", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: logits, probabilities, loss"}, {"id": "m48-032", "type": "arrow", "x": 390, "y": 1050, "width": 0, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000032, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000132, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0W", "points": [[0, 0], [0, 60]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-033", "type": "text", "x": 414, "y": 1062, "width": 520, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000033, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000133, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0X", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "compare each score row with its known label", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "compare each score row with its known label", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "compare each score row with its known label"}, {"id": "m48-034", "type": "rectangle", "x": 90, "y": 1115, "width": 600, "height": 245, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000034, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000134, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0Y", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-035", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 1135, "width": 548, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000035, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000135, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0Z", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "4. loss_tensor.backward()", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "4. loss_tensor.backward()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "4. loss_tensor.backward()"}, {"id": "m48-036", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 1181, "width": 548, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000036, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000136, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0a", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "CrossEntropyLoss measures prediction error.\nBackward calculates each weight gradient:\nwhich direction locally increases loss,\nand how sensitive loss is to that weight.\nWeights have not been updated yet.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CrossEntropyLoss measures prediction error.\nBackward calculates each weight gradient:\nwhich direction locally increases loss,\nand how sensitive loss is to that weight.\nWeights have not been updated yet.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "CrossEntropyLoss measures prediction error.\nBackward calculates each weight gradient:\nwhich direction locally increases loss,\nand how sensitive loss is to that weight.\nWeights have not been updated yet."}, {"id": "m48-037", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 1322, "width": 548, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000037, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000137, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0b", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: backpropagation", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: backpropagation", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: backpropagation"}, {"id": "m48-038", "type": "rectangle", "x": 830, "y": 1115, "width": 600, "height": 245, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000038, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000138, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0c", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-039", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 1135, "width": 548, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000039, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000139, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0d", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Observed run: 2 images, 2 epochs", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Observed run: 2 images, 2 epochs", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Observed run: 2 images, 2 epochs"}, {"id": "m48-040", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 1181, "width": 548, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000040, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000140, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0e", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "batch_size=2 -> 1 batch per epoch\n2 epochs -> 2 real optimizer updates\nEpoch loss: 1.4572 -> 1.4210\nThese are tiny-fixture observations,\nnot evidence of real galaxy accuracy.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "batch_size=2 -> 1 batch per epoch\n2 epochs -> 2 real optimizer updates\nEpoch loss: 1.4572 -> 1.4210\nThese are tiny-fixture observations,\nnot evidence of real galaxy accuracy.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "batch_size=2 -> 1 batch per epoch\n2 epochs -> 2 real optimizer updates\nEpoch loss: 1.4572 -> 1.4210\nThese are tiny-fixture observations,\nnot evidence of real galaxy accuracy."}, {"id": "m48-041", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 1322, "width": 548, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000041, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000141, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0f", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: one step versus a loop", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: one step versus a loop", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: one step versus a loop"}, {"id": "m48-042", "type": "arrow", "x": 390, "y": 1365, "width": 0, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000042, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000142, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0g", "points": [[0, 0], [0, 60]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-043", "type": "text", "x": 414, "y": 1377, "width": 520, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000043, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000143, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0h", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "gradients tell SGD how to change weights", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "gradients tell SGD how to change weights", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "gradients tell SGD how to change weights"}, {"id": "m48-044", "type": "rectangle", "x": 90, "y": 1430, "width": 600, "height": 215, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000044, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000144, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0i", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-045", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 1450, "width": 548, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000045, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000145, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0j", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "5. optimizer.step()", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "5. optimizer.step()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "5. optimizer.step()"}, {"id": "m48-046", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 1496, "width": 548, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000046, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000146, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0k", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "SGD: new_weight = old_weight - lr * grad.\nEach weight has its own gradient.\nClear old gradients before the next batch;\nthen compute its new forward pass.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "SGD: new_weight = old_weight - lr * grad.\nEach weight has its own gradient.\nClear old gradients before the next batch;\nthen compute its new forward pass.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "SGD: new_weight = old_weight - lr * grad.\nEach weight has its own gradient.\nClear old gradients before the next batch;\nthen compute its new forward pass."}, {"id": "m48-047", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 1607, "width": 548, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000047, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000147, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0l", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: optimizer and weight changes", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: optimizer and weight changes", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: optimizer and weight changes"}, {"id": "m48-048", "type": "rectangle", "x": 830, "y": 1430, "width": 600, "height": 215, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000048, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000148, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0m", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-049", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 1450, "width": 548, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000049, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000149, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0n", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Loss average: count images, not batches", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Loss average: count images, not batches", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Loss average: count images, not batches"}, {"id": "m48-050", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 1496, "width": 548, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000050, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000150, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0o", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Illustrative uneven-batch example:\n2 images, mean loss 1; 1 image, mean 3.\n(2*1 + 1*3) / 3 = 1.6667, not 2.0.\nThis fixes reporting, not the SGD formula.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Illustrative uneven-batch example:\n2 images, mean loss 1; 1 image, mean 3.\n(2*1 + 1*3) / 3 = 1.6667, not 2.0.\nThis fixes reporting, not the SGD formula.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Illustrative uneven-batch example:\n2 images, mean loss 1; 1 image, mean 3.\n(2*1 + 1*3) / 3 = 1.6667, not 2.0.\nThis fixes reporting, not the SGD formula."}, {"id": "m48-051", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 1607, "width": 548, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000051, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000151, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0p", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: sample-weighted loss", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: sample-weighted loss", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: sample-weighted loss"}, {"id": "m48-052", "type": "arrow", "x": 88, "y": 1538, "width": 60, "height": 908, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000052, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000152, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0q", "points": [[0, 0], [-60, 0], [-60, -908], [0, -908]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-053", "type": "text", "x": 90, "y": 1665, "width": 1340, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000053, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000153, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0r", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Dashed return: next batch; after the last batch, begin the next epoch. Same model.", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Dashed return: next batch; after the last batch, begin the next epoch. Same model.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Dashed return: next batch; after the last batch, begin the next epoch. Same model."}, {"id": "m48-054", "type": "arrow", "x": 390, "y": 1700, "width": 0, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000054, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000154, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0s", "points": [[0, 0], [0, 60]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-055", "type": "text", "x": 414, "y": 1712, "width": 520, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000055, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000155, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0t", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "after ALL epochs, main() evaluates then saves", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "after ALL epochs, main() evaluates then saves", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "after ALL epochs, main() evaluates then saves"}, {"id": "m48-056", "type": "rectangle", "x": 90, "y": 1765, "width": 600, "height": 240, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000056, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000156, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0u", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-057", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 1785, "width": 548, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000057, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 48000157, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0v", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "6. run_torch_checkpoint_round_trip()", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "6. run_torch_checkpoint_round_trip()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "6. run_torch_checkpoint_round_trip()"}, {"id": "m48-058", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 1831, "width": 548, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000058, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000158, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0w", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "main() first evaluates the trained model.\nThen save weights, load a fresh CNN,\nand compare predictions: they match.\nNeither evaluation nor reload trains it.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "main() first evaluates the trained model.\nThen save weights, load a fresh CNN,\nand compare predictions: they match.\nNeither evaluation nor reload trains it.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "main() first evaluates the trained model.\nThen save weights, load a fresh CNN,\nand compare predictions: they match.\nNeither evaluation nor reload trains it."}, {"id": "m48-059", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 1967, "width": 548, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000059, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000159, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0x", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: checkpoint round trip", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: checkpoint round trip", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: checkpoint round trip"}, {"id": "m48-060", "type": "rectangle", "x": 830, "y": 1765, "width": 600, "height": 240, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000060, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000160, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0y", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "m48-061", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 1785, "width": 548, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000161, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b0z", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "evaluate_torch_model()", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "evaluate_torch_model()", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "evaluate_torch_model()"}, {"id": "m48-062", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 1831, "width": 548, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000062, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000162, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b10", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Read-only checks use the final loop model.\nThe separate one-step proof is not saved.\nM49 now stores preprocessing with weights\nso training CLI and API use the same input.\nSee the checkpoint preprocessing diagram.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Read-only checks use the final loop model.\nThe separate one-step proof is not saved.\nM49 now stores preprocessing with weights\nso training CLI and API use the same input.\nSee the checkpoint preprocessing diagram.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Read-only checks use the final loop model.\nThe separate one-step proof is not saved.\nM49 now stores preprocessing with weights\nso training CLI and API use the same input.\nSee the checkpoint preprocessing diagram."}, {"id": "m48-063", "type": "text", "x": 854, "y": 1967, "width": 548, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 48000063, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48000163, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788912000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b11", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: the complete loop", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": 